OL,3,GNEWSAFamily plea for CCTV of man's boat
OL,4,Aparty death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man who died after
OL,7,Ffalling from a boat party in Portugal
OL,8,Fhave demanded to see CCTV footage of
OL,9,Fhis final moments.
OL,11,FJulian Amaral's sister said they still
OL,12,Fhad no answers as to how the
OL,13,F23-year-old from Buckinghamshire fell,
OL,14,Fmore than two months after the tragedy
OL,15,Fin Lisbon.
OL,17,F"We're never going to be able to heal
OL,18,Ffrom this until we find out what
OL,19,Fhappened," she told the BBC.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
